{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:39:35+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:39:35+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Croda International Plc","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"United Kingdom","city":"Goole","website":"https://www.croda.com","employees":5954,"summary":"Croda International Plc engages in the consumer care, life science, and industrial specialty businesses in Europe, the Middle East, Africa, North America, Asia, and Latin America. The company offers consumer care products across beauty care, beauty actives, and home care products, as well as fragrances and flavours. It also provides biologics drug delivery, crop protection, and seed coating systems and enhancement technologies to improve germination. In addition, the company offers industrial specialties, including phase change materials; surfactants, such as emulsifiers, dispersants, wetting agents, detergents, and polymerics; and formulated textile and spin finishes. Croda International Plc was incorporated in 1925 and is headquartered in Goole, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Croda International Plc exerce ses activités dans les secteurs des soins aux consommateurs, des sciences de la vie et des spécialités industrielles en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en Amérique du Nord, en Asie et en Amérique latine. La société propose des produits de soins de consommation à travers les soins de beauté, les actifs de beauté et les produits de soins à domicile, ainsi que des parfums et des saveurs. Il fournit également des médicaments biologiques, des systèmes de protection des cultures et d'enrobage des semences et des technologies d'amélioration pour améliorer la germination."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":null,"shares_outstanding":null,"trailing_pe":63.385967,"forward_pe":20.36583,"price_to_b